        "subject": "=Follow-up: {{ $('Append or update row in sheet').item.json.Property }} in {{ $('Append or update row in sheet').item.json.Location }}",
        "message": "=<p>Hi {{ $('Append or update row in sheet').item.json.Name }},</p>\n\n<p>I’m following up regarding your interest in a \n{{ $('Append or update row in sheet').item.json.Property }} \nproperty in {{ $('Append or update row in sheet').item.json.Location }}.</p>\n\n<p>We would be happy to help you find suitable options within your budget of \n₹{{ $('Append or update row in sheet').item.json.Budget }}.</p>\n\n<p>If you're still looking, please reply with your preferred sector/locality and your expected possession timeline. We can then share suitable property options with you.</p>\n\n<p>If you have any questions, feel free to reply to this email or contact us directly.</p>\n\nWarm regards,\n\nAjirul alam\nReal Estate Consultant\nNoida Property Hub\nPhone: +91-XXXXXXXXXX\nEmail: your-email@example.com",
        "options": {}
